  "content": "[Intro]\n[Eb]\n[Ebmaj7]\n[Abmaj7]\n[Bbsus4]I know your\n\n[Verse]\n[Eb]eyes in the [Gm]morning sun\n[Fm7][C]I feel you touch\n[Fm7]me in the [G7]pouring rain\n[Bbsus4]And the mo-\n[Eb]ment that you [Gm]wander far\n[Cm]from me I wanna\n[Fm]feel you in my arms again\n[Bbsus4]And you come\n[Ab]to me on a sum-\n[Gm]mer breeze Keep me warm\n[Fm]in your love then you soft-\n[Dbmaj7]ly leave And it's\n[Gm]me you need to show\n[Bbsus4]How deep is your love\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]Is your love, how deep\n[Ebmaj7]is your love?\n[Abmaj7]I really need to learn\n[Abm6]Cause we're\n[Eb]living in a world of fools\n[Db6]Breaking us\n[C7]down When they all\nshould let us be\n[Fm]We belong\n[Abm]to you and me\n[Eb]  [Gm]\n[Bbsus4]\nHow deep\n[Eb]is your love? How deep\n[Ebmaj7]is your love?\n[Abmaj7]I really need to learn\n[Abm6]Cause we're\n[Eb]living in a world of fools\n[Db6]Breaking us\n[C7]down When they all\nshould let us be\n[Fm]We belong\n[Abm]to you and me\n[Eb]  [Gm]\n[Bbsus4]\n[Eb6]",
